## Why This Is Asked
The prompt evaluates real-world modular Android architecture capabilities, specifically focusing on dynamic ML model management, performance guarantees, and operational reliability at enterprise scale.

## Key Concepts
- Modular Android architecture with isolated feature modules
- Runtime TensorFlow Lite model loading and hot-swapping
- Centralized inference routing and lifecycle management
- Semantic versioning with rollback capabilities
- Model integrity verification using cryptographic checksums
- Performance budgeting across heterogeneous device ecosystems
- Automated performance validation and adaptive resource management

